1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:06,625
Two of America's best national parks in one drive!

2
00:00:06,625 --> 00:00:09,271
A tunnel blasted through solid rock.

3
00:00:09,271 --> 00:00:11,990
Two red rock arches over the highway.

4
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:14,930
And thousands of glowing orange hoodoos!

5
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:20,775
This is Zion to Bryce Canyon: about 85 miles through Utah's red rock country.

6
00:00:20,775 --> 00:00:24,080
Stick around till the end for the full trip planner!

7
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:26,121
Here's the plan!

8
00:00:26,121 --> 00:00:33,620
We start in Springdale, then Canyon Overlook, Checkerboard Mesa and Red Canyon, and we finish at Bryce Canyon!

9
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:38,500
We're starting in Springdale, right outside Zion National Park!

10
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:44,550
Hop on the shuttle up Zion Canyon, where red cliffs tower up to 2,000 feet over the Virgin River.

11
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:52,460
Up the switchbacks, and into the Zion-Mount Carmel Tunnel, over a mile long, blasted right through the rock!

12
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:56,991
Right past the tunnel is the Canyon Overlook Trail!

13
00:00:56,991 --> 00:01:03,170
It's only about a mile round trip, and the view straight down Zion Canyon is incredible.

14
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:09,800
East through the slickrock, swirls of sandstone that used to be giant sand dunes!

15
00:01:10,750 --> 00:01:12,779
Check out Checkerboard Mesa!

16
00:01:12,779 --> 00:01:18,430
Ancient sand dunes turned to stone, then cracked into a checkerboard by frost.

17
00:01:18,430 --> 00:01:21,400
Watch for bighorn sheep on the slickrock!

18
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:27,870
North on US 89 through Long Valley, then east onto Scenic Byway 12!

19
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:30,211
Welcome to Red Canyon!

20
00:01:30,211 --> 00:01:34,761
The highway goes right through two tunnels cut into the bright red rock.

21
00:01:34,761 --> 00:01:38,680
Stop at the visitor center for a short hike among the hoodoos.

22
00:01:39,630 --> 00:01:43,630
Up onto the plateau, and into Bryce Canyon National Park!

23
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:46,616
We made it to Bryce Canyon!

24
00:01:46,616 --> 00:01:51,670
Stand at Sunset Point and look down at thousands of orange hoodoos.

25
00:01:51,670 --> 00:01:55,290
Then hike down in among them on the Navajo Loop!

26
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,756
And that's the drive!

27
00:01:57,756 --> 00:02:02,450
About 85 miles from the floor of Zion Canyon to the rim of Bryce.

28
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:06,560
Here's your trip planner, everything in one place.

29
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,330
Pause and grab a screenshot!

30
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:13,592
Thanks for riding along!

31
00:02:13,592 --> 00:02:20,570
Subscribe to Road Trip Atlas for more Utah road trips, and next time we're driving Scenic Byway 12!
